text = "TileSet Test Scene - TILE DESIGN EXPLAINED

The borders you see are INTENTIONAL art style (3D beveled edges).
Use the simpler 'block' tiles or connect terrain tiles properly:
- terrain_grass_block_top + terrain_grass_block_center = clean connection
- Or use: block_blue, block_green, block_red (simple flat platforms)

TIP: Search for 'block_' in the tile palette for simple platforms!

1. Select the TileMapLayer node
2. Click the 'TileMap' tab at the bottom
3. Choose tiles from the palette on the right
4. Click/drag in the viewport to paint tiles!

Press F5 to run and test collision physics."
